{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B54E1747","title":"Ava A Round of Annoyingly Helpful Advice","entry":"Dlg_B54E1747::entry","exit":"Dlg_B54E1747::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_58487835","articyId":"72057619807781225","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So, that package Edison left you. The one you agreed to bring to the Gen Debtors?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, that package Edison left you. The one you agreed to bring to the Gen Debtors?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-275.0,"y":1075.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21859","byteOffset":16158104,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_7E9FA168","articyId":"72057619807781239","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Well, I just wanted to serve you the gentle reminder that we are in fact currently under lockdown so perhaps this isn't the smartest idea?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I just wanted to serve you the gentle reminder that we are in fact currently under lockdown so perhaps this isn't the smartest idea?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":312.0,"y":1075.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36905","byteOffset":28305464,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_763B0DD5","articyId":"72057619807781268","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Of course it's a lockdown. That was the original name, but CorpSec found that lockdown didn't go over well when they focus-grouped it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course it's a lockdown. That was the original name, but CorpSec found that lockdown didn't go over well when they focus-grouped it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":1075.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46114","byteOffset":31776520,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_B6669C02","articyId":"72057619807781276","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"There is that, yes. I'm not specifically saying don't. I just want to express caution and a bit of discretion.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There is that, yes. I'm not specifically saying don't. I just want to express caution and a bit of discretion.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52592","byteOffset":34310208,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_61BAAA83","articyId":"72057619807781298","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"More like, how about some discretion if you go through with this. Just an idea.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"More like, how about some discretion if you go through with this. Just an idea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":1075.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31342","byteOffset":19737448,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_B57F109E","articyId":"72057619807781307","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes, and while my understanding of morality tells me you should honor that, the analytical part of my programming wants me to tell you that this is a bit risky. I would recommend discretion.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, and while my understanding of morality tells me you should honor that, the analytical part of my programming wants me to tell you that this is a bit risky. I would recommend discretion.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":1400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40170","byteOffset":29526624,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_182B2E6C","articyId":"72057619807781339","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"So... that interaction with Edison was a little awkward, huh?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So... that interaction with Edison was a little awkward, huh?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-475.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29459","byteOffset":19023744,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_AD17919C","articyId":"72057619807781368","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"And what if his little errand could help with the business?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And what if his little errand could help with the business?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":125.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31965","byteOffset":19974800,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_FDBFC605","articyId":"72057619807781376","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"They are children he's helping.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They are children he's helping.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":125.0,"y":-325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22047","byteOffset":16227336,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_C1CCEA5C","articyId":"72057619807781422","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Then why do you feel bad?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Then why do you feel bad?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":-75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20074","byteOffset":15479480,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_75294533","articyId":"72057619807781436","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Never too late to change your mind. Unless they're dead, then it would be too late.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Never too late to change your mind. Unless they're dead, then it would be too late.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":725.0,"y":-450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32900","byteOffset":20331136,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_DC831E27","articyId":"72057619807781458","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"If you'd like to help him, I can ping him for you. Just let me know.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you'd like to help him, I can ping him for you. Just let me know.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":-325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41467","byteOffset":30015352,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_348295B2","articyId":"72057619807781511","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Of course.","speak